            <div xml:id="m-62b7333f-214d-4197-85cd-042790f6ee15">
              <lg xml:id="m-56f50988-a5ac-4166-b0dc-52170408a9b1">
                <l xml:id="m-8c8155fa-f2b9-4417-b063-8d922119f488" facs="#m-41922308-1994-4f21-a264-bfb7b77cc209" label="ambiguous">1132</l><l xml:id="m-6861d3e9-0c60-4f47-b791-3be72884cfae" facs="#m-4fa56213-f2f2-49b9-bc57-2de37c444220" label="text-like">Common of a Martyr-Bishop. Mass. II.</l><l xml:id="m-52750af2-5b02-49e4-ab0d-c53f4aff84f6" facs="#m-72585160-aea0-4435-94fd-0a952bfcdfda" label="lyrics-like">qui non bájulat crucem suam, et summáre? Aut quis rex itúrus com¬</l><l xml:id="m-f343b37a-74c7-4b13-b636-a8456af7d1f3" facs="#m-4217241d-e929-407a-b79e-870addb5fb46" label="lyrics-like">venit post me, non potest meus esse ] mittere bellum advérsus álium re¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9a73f62-41f7-4e3e-85f7-fb1901ba907e" facs="#m-63c37128-a555-4d8a-ae97-048134d2b095" label="lyrics-like">gem, non sedens prius cógitat, si</l><l xml:id="m-9862a57e-0c65-46c4-b2c5-3e047fadbad4" facs="#m-3e549a0e-8052-46a6-92be-95d71d8602cb" label="lyrics-like">discípulus. Quis enim ex vobis vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-7258c961-7e4e-4c93-a177-7c409ac9afd9" facs="#m-2f5b74ef-580d-48fe-8076-cfb930c92401" label="lyrics-like">possit cum decem millibus occúr¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5dbe02d-ccca-4f11-a68a-53b323ccfd52" facs="#m-d982ac22-a02e-4eaa-b4e6-e3fe573a30f3" label="lyrics-like">tens turrim aedificáre, non prius</l><l xml:id="m-fef6057c-e331-4ac5-88b4-967f4bbdfd52" facs="#m-2551b074-e742-471a-aa03-7ea3c36d1018" label="lyrics-like">rere ei, qui cum vigínti millibus</l><l xml:id="m-4cde5019-50f2-4731-8fc9-d945c7d54b28" facs="#m-ad17f81b-48f6-4ea2-b2f1-62256bbfd5c0" label="lyrics-like">sedens cómputat sumptus, qui ne¬</l><l xml:id="m-be37883f-282d-4222-8fae-4e2b1e8131e4" facs="#m-bfb7090c-89eb-4a50-85e3-0fda4c9e341c" label="lyrics-like">cessárii sunt, si hábeat ad perficién¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9fa055d-86fb-4c1c-b3c6-49d3a7ac4a44" facs="#m-ba82d11f-9ee2-44fe-81ff-6e6e0a8c510e" label="lyrics-like">venit ad se? Alióquin, adhuc illo</l><l xml:id="m-49c45137-4db3-4777-9add-29a123b84691" facs="#m-db856e38-af35-4fd3-b78b-a9c3c1139883" label="lyrics-like">longe agénte, legatiónem mittens,</l><l xml:id="m-a160db26-e51e-4d2e-9dd6-a998d0a43323" facs="#m-d72379ff-739c-458b-8bfc-00b7c2e1c419" label="lyrics-like">dum; ne, posteáquam posüerit fun¬</l><l xml:id="m-43170038-e542-43df-ad06-41fb06a75609" facs="#m-3fc0a7f5-f49e-4126-bbfe-2b860ce5ebdf" label="ambiguous">rogat ea quae pacis sunt. Sic ergo</l><l xml:id="m-770a7dc4-fd49-4958-b021-2766389a1ffd" facs="#m-17930f30-52e3-44fc-a300-a013764315e3" label="lyrics-like">daméntum, et non potúerit perfi¬</l><l xml:id="m-11a40d94-2c1c-45ab-a831-0e1c7288d452" facs="#m-c79e20dc-ac82-4dd9-a1cc-ad94b8e5dce2" label="ambiguous">cere, omnes, qui vident, incspiant</l><l xml:id="m-cb38e619-9ade-4b42-a89d-47e49635cfe3" facs="#m-af5be1b4-124c-4693-9364-9efdeee331ab" label="lyrics-like">omnis ex vobis, qui non renúntiat</l><l xml:id="m-20766d0e-2035-4e9f-b745-1cb50b167e3a" facs="#m-09ed9f53-c039-4322-a9ec-941cad4ed261" label="lyrics-like">illúdere ei, dicéntes : Quia hic homo</l><l xml:id="m-a208dc99-8b19-42e2-96c0-346f69c704af" facs="#m-aeb5dc73-c0a4-46d9-80c0-1c5bd3f93982" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus quae póssidet, non potest</l><l xml:id="m-dddd3da8-7898-43eb-8c57-1cd5e3cde25e" facs="#m-94d9218d-b480-48a5-b44c-596ca241c8c5" label="lyrics-like">coepit aedificáre, et non pótuit con- meus esse discipulus.</l><l xml:id="m-583d2899-c626-4630-a482-2fefaa2d94d2" facs="#m-d68e66f0-7cc9-4224-b8e5-95bce0f11e1a" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Véritas méa. p. 1203.</l><l xml:id="m-61b9c7bd-6a6d-4622-85c0-a304de2088ed" facs="#m-ae2ead14-d435-464d-9cd5-48a281349283" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b02d0aea-9820-44db-87f9-f2d36716b20c" facs="#m-3c9d4428-f095-456e-873a-3ce1e7569a2d" label="lyrics-like">Ostias tibi, Dómine, beáti N. ] et ad perpétuum nobis tribue pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-9740a6ad-c89e-49a6-b2ed-07c326bbd5e6" facs="#m-90a87e9b-b79e-40be-9b6c-affc85e0e51e" label="lyrics-like">It Mártyris tui atque Pontificis venire subsidium. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-938f85f2-7d7d-4299-be52-57d77036c273" facs="#m-dace2db4-14e0-44ab-a5cb-9d70060e69f5" label="lyrics-like">dicátas méritis, benignus assúme: nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-45609c3b-b339-45ea-b34b-95224a82daa1" facs="#m-45ac3dd7-77c3-44cd-a60e-6d4faee6f758" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-6cbd67ba-d481-4d97-8acf-967d0499e8cc" facs="#m-fce5bcd2-5272-4343-89a3-101f903eeefd" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-bb196261-3a12-442d-98c1-c378e3466e0e" facs="#m-b32a7156-8bf7-42fd-96ec-eed83d9ad6d8" label="lyrics-like">Emel jurávi "in sáncto mé-:sémen éjus</l><l xml:id="m-44f5991f-9549-401f-84d1-0bd574bc647c" facs="#m-d481adfb-9872-49a6-8c38-07e2f9a1abfe" label="lyrics-like">in ae-térnum ma-né¬ bit: et sédes é-jus sic-ut sol in</l><l xml:id="m-ecf55a18-523e-4dfa-b766-5685570692f6" facs="#m-2523c376-4183-4fa3-8807-cc8836e0f275" label="lyrics-like">conspéctu mé- o, et sic-ut lúna perfécta in aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f89c116-db0a-48ee-bc95-1d4f33700807" facs="#m-d26a310e-6646-40df-b601-b34de18dcd27" label="lyrics-like">num: et téstis in caélo fidé¬ lis.</l><l xml:id="m-35958b3f-e37d-4f50-9952-a10a11c79dcb" facs="#m-11da2145-5b9f-49a9-a843-397db73e1172" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ce4caf55-6620-47bf-aafb-de49c53aa0a6" facs="#m-1ce6f8e4-71f8-4435-846d-4d452ba57de2" label="lyrics-like">DEfécti participatióne múneris! tum, intercedénte beâto N. Már¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1bd4204-0a01-46fe-a068-ca6c1128fb9e" facs="#m-ae011cf5-8cdc-4d6c-93ae-f394e68997fc" label="lyrics-like">Lt sacri, quaésumus Dómine Deus ]tyre tuo atque Pontífice, sentiámus</l><l xml:id="m-f0788668-9e81-4cb6-be2d-99e1e7823d4e" facs="#m-4a5e2a1f-0783-46f6-b395-2526163013a1" label="lyrics-like">noster: ut cujus exséquimur cul- efféctum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d5372aa1-6f0a-4607-ac5e-1c7f0e4af435" facs="#m-65424d9e-e8db-44d5-bfcf-34ce3af650f1" label="text-like">H. ANOTHER MASS OF A MARTYR-BISHOP.</l><l xml:id="m-492aae93-7211-4dcb-8425-e3d42dcc4b1b" facs="#m-64df4319-767e-42fb-83a1-217b6b21bc66" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-6aa57232-de53-4faa-9f5d-b0130bd1687f" facs="#m-4f03fda6-e159-4d76-b705-5569b9a22dd9" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-c3e92352-0aa3-4afe-ada0-4afba56d6b3c" facs="#m-01d1c1c9-f712-41cc-9a09-190f3b8d69fd" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-7b869eed-b4b5-49da-b710-4c515d0f2b41" facs="#m-83c31b62-fcfe-4f15-b44d-dcfc5d053bf9" label="lyrics-like">A-cer-dó- tes Dé-i," bene-dí-ci-te</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>